  "body_html": "<p>1. 今天伦敦气温达到了罕见的 30 度。</p><p>2. 傍晚出现大量尾迹飞机。</p><p>3.「在意空气」显示 O3 浓度达到 138（中度污染），部分地区为“空气污染高”。</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WsS3!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F51a5bbc9-364a-44eb-a42d-d3e53b690c42_315x640.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WsS3!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F51a5bbc9-364a-44eb-a42d-d3e53b690c42_315x640.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WsS3!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F51a5bbc9-364a-44eb-a42d-d3e53b690c42_315x640.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WsS3!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F51a5bbc9-364a-44eb-a42d-d3e53b690c42_315x640.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WsS3!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F51a5bbc9-364a-44eb-a42d-d3e53b690c42_315x640.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WsS3!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F51a5bbc9-364a-44eb-a42d-d3e53b690c42_315x640.jpeg\" width=\"315\" height=\"640\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/51a5bbc9-364a-44eb-a42d-d3e53b690c42_315x640.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&qu